<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62453" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπῐδωτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>scaly</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέρμα</span>, of
			the crocodile, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.68
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχθύες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					505a24
				</span></i>
			, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paul.Aeg.
					6.78
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θώρηξ λ.</span> a cuirass <i>covered with
				scales</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.22
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				78.37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ., ὁ</span>, a
			fish of the Nile <i>with large scales</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.72
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυπρῖνος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dorio
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.309b
			</span></i>. (Prob. <i>Cyprinus bynni.</i>) </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a kind of <i>gem</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>L.</u>
				287
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
